ef # XXXX ) who reviewed all of the previous notes made by all of the agents I spoke with. I mentioned to her that the {$630.00} from the transfer was due for my rent and that I am being charged a late fee for every day the payment is missed. She said she would expedite this to the investigations team as I since I am being charged a late fee for every day the payment is missed. I received numerous automated emails as follow up repeating stating the same information. 

