6989195,2023-05-18,"Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports",Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"Dear CFPB, I XXXX XXXX XXXX 100 % AM THE ONLY WRITER OF THIS DOCUMENT. AND SIGN THAT ONLY I HAVE PRODUCED ALL INFORMATION STATED BELOW. 

